# careers.coralpetal.ai — Apache rules for Hostinger. This folder sits inside the main
# docroot but is its own site: a sub-folder .htaccess does NOT inherit the parent's
# rewrite rules, so everything careers needs is here.
# HTTPS is forced by Hostinger (hPanel), not here (the CDN terminates TLS).

Options -Indexes
DirectoryIndex index.html
ErrorDocument 404 /404.html
